# Build context for the website image. Secrets never enter an image: the only run-time variable is SERVER_URL, so
# every .env* stays out of the context.
**/.env*
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
# Playwright sign-in state: live session cookies for the e2e accounts.
**/e2e/.auth
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.git
.claude
.superpowers
